// DECOMP had exactly one affix and it granted two points, so a capture
// build's only affix roll was an uncommon one. This is its floor: the
// small, common version, off Weapon for the reason its bigger sibling is
// (a weapon is the slot most likely to end up on a companion, where DECOMP
// does nothing at all).
(
    id: "patched",
    prefix: Some("Patched"),
    stats: (decompiler: 1),
    slots: Some([Module, Armor]),
    weight: 11,
)
